      "id": "claim_d8634c2425824228b7802e654491ed5b",
      "statement": "Coverage F in the reviewed MS HO-3 2018-09 and 2024-03 and HO-6 2023-02 forms is a no-fault grant for necessary medical expenses because of bodily injury caused by an accident; qualification remains subject to each form's stated requirements.",
