      "id": "claim_bed05182ab714208b9177b1f5f429b6d",
      "statement": "Coverage F's location and activity gateways materially differ: the 2018 HO-3 covers an accident on an insured location and off-location injury from insured activities, qualifying residence-employee work, or an insured-owned/cared-for animal; the 2024 HO-3 and HO-6 require permission for their on-location route and define different off-location condition, employee, and animal requirements.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://forms/HO/MS/HO-3/2018-09.md#L1151-L1157",
