      "statement": "The reviewed form language does not state a Coverage F dollar amount: HO-3 2018-09 caps payment at the applicable limit for medical expenses arising from an accident, while the reviewed HO-3 2024-03 and HO-6 2023-02 Coverage F grants contain no numeric limit statement; the applicable policy record must supply any actual dollar limit.",
